        //   1 section:   [POSITIVE/NEGATIVE/ZERO/TEXT]
        //   2 sections:  [POSITIVE/ZERO/TEXT] [NEGATIVE]
        //   3 sections:  [POSITIVE/TEXT] [NEGATIVE] [ZERO]
        //   4 sections:  [POSITIVE] [NEGATIVE] [ZERO] [TEXT]
